    "repository": "https://github.com/OscarYau525/FSPDA",
    "commit": "0808887c6e9f713ca203df3138fb8995094be694",
    "contract": "FSPDA-SA simultaneous old-state descent/ascent, paper (7) and Appendix A (35)-(36): L_i=sum Cij(x_i-x_j), x_next=x-lr*g-eta*u-gamma*L, u_next=u+beta*L; zero node dual startup.",
    "differences": [
      "Interpret opposite signs in paper (6)/(8b) as typos, following incidence definition, (7), (11), (36).",
      "Reference code uses new self minus old neighbors in dual ascent. Simulator uses old self minus old neighbors, preserving zero-sum dual. Audit measures discrepancy rather than claiming trajectory equivalence.",
      "Shared deterministic graph/mask schedule replaces reference mask-negotiation traffic; explicit sparse indices and values are charged. Global coordinate sampling rather than reference per-tensor sampling."
    ],
    "scope": "Stable membership; fully trainable common-dtype parameters and local buffers; local_steps=1, momentum=0. Neighbor-round blocking with old-model/gradient overlap; optional global barrier. No STORM, stale-message asynchronous counter/rescaling, optimizer momentum/Adam, compression noise, local blocks, churn or LoRA."
  },
  "environment": {
    "conda_prefix": "/mnt/data/mdevos/conda/envs/conflux-gpu",
    "python": "3.12.15",
    "torch": "2.14.1+cu130",
    "numpy": "2.5.4",
    "device": "cuda:0",
    "gpu": "NVIDIA RTX 5000 Ada Generation"
  },
  "tests": {
    "command": "python -m pytest -q",
    "passed": 781,
    "warnings": 5,
    "duration_seconds": 121.0,
    "fspda_specific_cases": 54,
    "checks": [
      "Independent incidence-matrix logistic trajectories; two graphs, two sampling modes, dense/sparse masks, skew and barriers",
      "Zero-sum dual and mean gradient invariants; convergence to exact unequal-quadratic optimum",
      "Old-state ascent, persistent dual forces on isolated iterations, local buffers and immutable inputs",
      "Exact payload bytes, overlap/readiness, early/duplicates, small graphs, duration stop",
      "Seeded serialized DAG replay, streaming snapshots, CPU/CUDA model/dual/packet agreement",
      "Shared CLI, comparison aliases and broker settings registration; full maintained regression suite"
    ]
  },
